From fbb8d75205a3845b6ded790bbfcd3f191c8f7e50 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 09:57:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ci(swift): run the Linux leg on ubuntu-24.04

ubuntu-latest now resolves to the ubuntu-26.04 image. SwiftyLab/setup-swift
still installs swift-6.0.2-RELEASE-ubuntu2404 there, and `make test` dies
before compiling anything:

  swift-test: error while loading shared libraries: libxml2.so.2: cannot
  open shared object file: No such file or directory

The leg passed on main on 2026-10-19, on the 24.04 image this pins back to.
Moving to a toolchain built for 26.04 is the longer fix, and a separate one.

Checks: build.yml parses as YAML. actionlint is not installed in the
session that wrote this, so it was not run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U3n7wUnBkRMxEHfh2ckvQ7
---
 .github/workflows/build.yml | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/build.yml b/.github/workflows/build.yml
index d0b0f85..44bef58 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/build.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/build.yml
@@ -535,7 +535,10 @@ jobs:
     runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}
     strategy:
       matrix:
-        os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest]
+        # ubuntu-24.04, not -latest: the 6.0.2 toolchain installed below is
+        # the ubuntu2404 build, and its swift-test links libxml2.so.2, which
+        # the ubuntu-26.04 image behind -latest does not ship.
+        os: [ubuntu-24.04, macos-latest]
     steps:
       - uses: actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1 # v7
       # The test runner is voxgig/omni, consumed as a local checkout (it is
